    "limitations": [
      "Diagnostic only: all-thread sampling requests a nominal 2 ms interval and adds overhead; these are not acceptance frame times.",
      "sample aggregates the full recording rather than preserving per-frame stacks; stripped engine frames cannot establish exact blocking ownership.",
      "Godot user shader cache was empty before this native launch; operating-system/driver caches were left intact. No claim of universally cold GPU state.",
      "The second destruction frame over 100 ms has unchanged pipeline counters; simulation catch-up is plausible but unproved.",
      "Per-viewport render CPU measurements are delayed: a later 61.724 ms frame reports 896.719 ms render CPU. Do not align that value directly to the same wall interval.",
      "No production fix or speculative prewarm was applied. No additional graphical rerun was performed after this bounded trace."
    ],
